        <mxCell id="arch-m41" value="&lt;b&gt;Capacity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Voice Live + voice agent: per-resource Voice Live limits (100 new connections/min, ≤120K TPM) — &lt;b&gt;shared&lt;/b&gt; by both&lt;br&gt;• Realtime: deployment capacity units (1 = 10K TPM + 20 RPM; often 10 = 100K TPM) — separate pool&lt;br&gt;• Voice agent is &lt;b&gt;public preview&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4CE;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1">
