        <mxCell id="arch-m55" value="&lt;b&gt;When an app is full:&lt;/b&gt; browser → busy + close 1013; ACS/Twilio → configured overflow number or busy/reject; Asterisk → HANGUP (dialplan handles fallback). No built-in human queue.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Standalone mode:&lt;/b&gt; each example has its own Foundry resource + project. Shared mode pools Voice Live service limits, not the three apps' admission counters. Confirm effective service limits before sizing." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F2F1;strokeColor=#605E5C;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1">
